title: Analyzing Korean political YouTube chats with Kouchou AI (Hankook Ilbo)
description: For a Hankook Ilbo story, 3,000 live-chat messages from six Korean political YouTube channels were analyzed with Kouchou AI. The opinion maps and figures are available in Japanese, English and Korean.
metas:
  lang: en
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl mt-10">
  <nav class="flex gap-2 text-sm" aria-label="言語 / Language / 언어">
    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline" href="../" hreflang="ja" lang="ja">日本語</a>
